    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horde Survivor and Base Defense mashup</h2><br>Halftime Builders is a Horde Survival. Kill enemies in different ways depending your class, learn different blueprints as you level up, mount your defense and die. Buy upgrades from the shop and start again!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 different bosses<br></li><li>4 classes with different playstyles, be a mobile mech or mount your fortress<br></li><li>Compete with other players for the best highscore<br></li><li>Combine different buildings to balance the best offense/defense<br></li><li>Combines elements from Tower Defense, Horde Survivor and Roguelike games!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different class with different playstyles!</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build a stronghold</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b70db83561e9180c1656bad314004cb6.poster.avif?t=1737481012\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b70db83561e9180c1656bad314004cb6.webm?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b70db83561e9180c1656bad314004cb6.mp4?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Form your destruction convoy</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/f5075fc9c268d8a5fb4f1633ac1c76da.poster.avif?t=1737481012\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/f5075fc9c268d8a5fb4f1633ac1c76da.webm?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/f5075fc9c268d8a5fb4f1633ac1c76da.mp4?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Or be a giant mecha</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b5f421f2bdeea057f63d1778887ab689.poster.avif?t=1737481012\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b5f421f2bdeea057f63d1778887ab689.webm?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b5f421f2bdeea057f63d1778887ab689.mp4?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Horde Survivor and Base Defense mashup</h2><br>Halftime Builders is a Horde Survival. Kill enemies in different ways depending your class, learn different blueprints as you level up, mount your defense and die. Buy upgrades from the shop and start again!<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>5 different bosses<br></li><li>4 classes with different playstyles, be a mobile mech or mount your fortress<br></li><li>Compete with other players for the best highscore<br></li><li>Combine different buildings to balance the best offense/defense<br></li><li>Combines elements from Tower Defense, Horde Survivor and Roguelike games!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Different class with different playstyles!</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Build a stronghold</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b70db83561e9180c1656bad314004cb6.poster.avif?t=1737481012\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b70db83561e9180c1656bad314004cb6.webm?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b70db83561e9180c1656bad314004cb6.mp4?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Form your destruction convoy</li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/f5075fc9c268d8a5fb4f1633ac1c76da.poster.avif?t=1737481012\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/f5075fc9c268d8a5fb4f1633ac1c76da.webm?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/f5075fc9c268d8a5fb4f1633ac1c76da.mp4?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Or be a giant mecha</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b5f421f2bdeea057f63d1778887ab689.poster.avif?t=1737481012\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b5f421f2bdeea057f63d1778887ab689.webm?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2342720/extras/b5f421f2bdeea057f63d1778887ab689.mp4?t=1737481012\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "short_description": "Halftime Builders is a game that mixes Tower Defense, Horde Survivor, RTS and Roguelike elements. Pick your defenses, build them up, collect scrap, level up and kill an endless amounts of mobs. Once you die use your hard earned gold to improve your chances and start again!",
